Package: propertycohorts
Type: Package
Title: Audit Comparability of Property Listing Cohorts
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("NovAsia", "Estate", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "info@novasia.estate")
Description: Audits two explicitly labelled listing snapshots before comparing
    their mean values. Reports excluded rows, unsupported cells, common-cohort
    coverage, and an exact symmetric decomposition into within-cell and
    composition differences. Produces local HTML and formula-safe CSV reports
    without runtime dependencies outside base R. These are descriptive audits
    of supplied observations, not market indices or causal estimates.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: graphics, utils
URL: https://novasia.estate/, https://github.com/novasia-estate/property-cohort-audit
BugReports: https://github.com/novasia-estate/property-cohort-audit/issues
